@SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5103

### Create an order
POST {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "SHOP-2002",
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "totalAmount": 149.99
}

### Check the order was created
POST {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "SHOP-2005",
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "totalAmount": 149.99
}

### Check the order was created
POST {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalId": "",
  "customerName": "Test Customer",
  "totalAmount": 149.99
}

### Get order by id
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Get order by id
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/9
Content-Type: application/json

### API health check
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live

### API and DB health check
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Get all orders
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### First orders
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders

### Second page of orders with page size of 5
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?pageNumber=2&pageSize=5

### Invalid page number
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?pageNumber=0

### Page size too large
GET {{SyncBridge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders?pageNumber=1&pageSize=101